  "comments": "<p>The standard weight of these coins was 2/11 troy ounce (87.3 grains).<br><br><i>1911 obverse die varieties:</i><br><strong>Obverse 1</strong> Hollow Neck - I of GEORGIVS points between beads;<br><strong>Obverse 2</strong> Hollow Neck - I of GEORGIVS points at a bead;<br><strong>Obverse 3</strong> Flat Neck - I of GEORGIVS points at a bead;<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cc410c758cb2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cc410c758cb2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><i>1912 reverse die varieties:</i><br><strong>Reverse A</strong> letters in IMP are close together;<br><strong>Reverse B</strong> letters in IMP are further apart;<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cc0249532b23.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cc0249532b23.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Images above are reproduced with kind permission of<br>Numista member Sjoelund and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"http://www.declanmageecoins.co.uk/G5S.html\">Declan Magee Coins</a></p>",
